### Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

### Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

### Create Professional Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

{
    "Username": "feitozabruno",
    "FullName": "Bruno Feitoza",
    "Specialty": "Desenvolvedor de Software",
    "BusinessName": "GitHub",
    "PhoneNumber": "67987654321",
    "Bio": "Especializado em software manutenível, testado e bem documentado.",
    "AddressCep": "79800-000",
    "AddressStreet": "Rua Zuckenberg",
    "AddressNumber": "789",
    "AddressNeightborhood": "Centro",
    "AddressCity": "São Francisco",
    "AddressState": "MS",
    "AddressComplement": "Próximo a empresa Meta"
}

### Read Professional Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals/me
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Read Professional Profile with Username
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals/feitozabruno

