### Create Professional Services
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

{
    "name": "Terapia",
    "price": 350,
    "durationMinutes": 60,
    "description": "Sessão de terapia comportamental."
}

### Read Professional Services
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/me
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Read Professional Available Slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals/04118d9e-5db9-4cc3-ad68-72f94884f27f/available-slots?serviceId=30d6cbe7-11e4-4cdf-8d2b-0401e5954be4&date=2026-09-08

### Create Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "professionalId": "04118d9e-5db9-4cc3-ad68-72f94884f27f",
    "serviceId": "30d6cbe7-11e4-4cdf-8d2b-0401e5954be4",
    "clientName": "Elon Musk",
    "clientEmail": "elonmusk@hotmail.com",
    "clientPhone": "10987654321",
    "startTime": "2026-09-08T13:00:00+00:00"
}

### Cancel Appointment By Professional Logged
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/5437ecec-e90d-47b7-b715-408a70fbe20b/cancel-by-professional
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Cancel Appointment By Client AccessToken
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/dce2357b-c7bd-4472-b948-7c9e9ec6683e/cancel-by-client?accessToken=e444d1221a544dd5a43d679908091bb8

### Upload Professional Avatar Photo
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals/me/photo
Cookie: jwt={{cookie}}

### Get Paged All Professionals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/professionals?page=1&pageSize=10